{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A BARA game built on a visual novel engine with RPG elements. <br>Choices matter for the main character, Kody. Not only must Kody decide if he should speak of the future, but also decide which details he will share. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The potential of 4 love interests or enemies await. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game installment covers a full day in Kody's adventure. This is Day 1 of 8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~15 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiced characters with separate volume control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A complex flow-chart leads to many multiple endings by the end of Day 8, possibly even a thruple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Kody be smart enough to navigate the past? Will he end up in a Sanatorium? Or, will he be a Himbo?\u00a0 Player choices matter...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589780?t=1743782760","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589780/4b9b8f14f79f835d3fbf751f7f5a620cb2f0cf93/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743782760","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589780/424d504d89cd1307ca020b9979118ecab1954ac5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743782760","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589780/424d504d89cd1307ca020b9979118ecab1954ac5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743782760","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A BARA game built on a visual novel engine with RPG elements. <br>Choices matter for the main character, Kody. Not only must Kody decide if he should speak of the future, but also decide which details he will share. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The potential of 4 love interests or enemies await. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game installment covers a full day in Kody's adventure. This is Day 1 of 8</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~15 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiced characters with separate volume control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A complex flow-chart leads to many multiple endings by the end of Day 8, possibly even a thruple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will Kody be smart enough to navigate the past? Will he end up in a Sanatorium? Or, will he be a Himbo?\u00a0 Player choices matter...</p>","developers":["Jaxx Cordd"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589780/6a70478c1951740c8cc18f3a99e0c41d7c33c68e/header.jpg?t=1743782760","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118119,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118119/movie480.mp4?t=1743615372","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118119/movie_max.mp4?t=1743615372"},"name":"SoST Playthrough 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118119/156344987096b1373ff9b99c193dd98c7439402f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743615372","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118119/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743615372","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118119/movi